From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Kamil=20Postro=C5=BCny?= <kamil@postrozny.pl>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:12:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=no_fp_preserve hides NaN and Inf
 preservation

KosmicKrisp reports shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat16/32 and
shaderFloatControls2. DXVK's dxbc-spirv starts every D3D11 shader with
NaN, Inf and signed zero preserved (fxc's refactoringAllowed only drops
the signed zero) and, where the device reports the property, says so:
on KosmicKrisp, which reports no independent denorm mode and so gets
dxbc-spirv's float controls 1 path, with SignedZeroInfNanPreserve as
the execution mode; with float controls 2 it would be FPFastMathDefault
without NotNaN and NotInf. Every float operation then reaches
nir_to_msl preserving NaN and Inf: each is wrapped in its own math
mode block, relaxed (safe if NoContraction, as every operation of a
shader without refactoringAllowed is, and all of Hollow Knight's are),
each multiplication becomes "!&buf0.contents[0] ? 1 : a * b"
(workaround 14) and abs, fma, min, max, rsqrt, sqrt and the like call
Metal's precise:: functions. DXMT's airconv compiles the same shaders
without NaN or Inf care and with Metal's fast functions.

With MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=no_fp_preserve the device reports neither
shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat16/32 nor VK_KHR_shader_float_controls2
and its feature. DXVK then emits no SignedZeroInfNanPreserve (nor
FPFastMathDefault); its NoContraction decorations, so the safe blocks,
stay. vkd3d-proton reads the same properties. Off by default: Vulkan
1.4 requires shaderFloatControls2, and a shader that relies on NaN or
Inf may draw differently, as with DXMT.

The MSL made from a given SPIR-V does not change; without the switch
nothing changes.

Linear: PLA-72
Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/plans/2026-10-06-vulkan-performance.md (Review 2026-10-21, lead 1)
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c           |  1 +
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h           |  7 +++++++
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c | 10 ++++++----
 3 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
index fb09572..9dc1746 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@ const struct debug_named_value experimental_flags[] = {
    {"library_size_opt", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_LIBRARY_SIZE_OPT},
    {"gpl", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_GPL},
    {"msl41", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MSL41},
+   {"no_fp_preserve", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_NO_FP_PRESERVE},
    {NULL, 0},
 };
 
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
index 65f2659..426fe3c 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
@@ -110,6 +110,13 @@ enum kk_experimental {
     * and advertise shaderSharedFloat32AtomicAdd, which needs it; by default
     * MSL is 4.0, which builds libraries 2-2.6x faster on the phone */
    KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MSL41 = 1ull << 7,
+   /* Playport (PLA-72): report neither shaderFloatControls2 (nor
+    * VK_KHR_shader_float_controls2) nor shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserve for
+    * 16- and 32-bit floats, so that DXVK asks for no NaN, Inf or signed zero
+    * preservation (no SignedZeroInfNanPreserve, no FPFastMathDefault): no
+    * workaround 14 guards, no precise:: functions. Below Vulkan 1.4's
+    * required features. */
+   KK_EXPERIMENTAL_NO_FP_PRESERVE = 1ull << 8,
 };
 
 extern enum kk_experimental kk_mesa_experimental_flags;
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
index becbbf8..a307f13 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
@@ -162,7 +162,8 @@ kk_get_device_extensions(const struct kk_instance *instance,
        * with MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=gpl (PLA-424) */
       .KHR_pipeline_library = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(GPL),
       .KHR_shader_expect_assume = true,
-      .KHR_shader_float_controls2 = true,
+      /* Playport (PLA-72): not with MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=no_fp_preserve */
+      .KHR_shader_float_controls2 = !KK_EXPERIMENTAL(NO_FP_PRESERVE),
       .KHR_shader_subgroup_rotate = true,
       .KHR_vertex_attribute_divisor = true,
       .EXT_graphics_pipeline_library = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(GPL),
@@ -392,7 +393,7 @@ kk_get_device_features(
       .maintenance6 = true,
       .pipelineRobustness = true,
       .pushDescriptor = true,
-      .shaderFloatControls2 = true,
+      .shaderFloatControls2 = !KK_EXPERIMENTAL(NO_FP_PRESERVE),
       .shaderSubgroupRotate = true,
       .shaderSubgroupRotateClustered = true,
       .vertexAttributeInstanceRateDivisor = true,
@@ -776,8 +777,9 @@ kk_get_device_properties(
       .conformanceVersion = (VkConformanceVersion){1, 4, 6, 2},
       .denormBehaviorIndependence = VK_SHADER_FLOAT_CONTROLS_INDEPENDENCE_NONE,
       .roundingModeIndependence = VK_SHADER_FLOAT_CONTROLS_INDEPENDENCE_NONE,
-      .shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat16 = true,
-      .shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat32 = true,
+      /* Playport (PLA-72): neither with MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=no_fp_preserve */
+      .shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat16 = !KK_EXPERIMENTAL(NO_FP_PRESERVE),
+      .shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat32 = !KK_EXPERIMENTAL(NO_FP_PRESERVE),
       .shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat64 = false,
       .shaderDenormPreserveFloat16 = false,
       .shaderDenormPreserveFloat32 = false,
